{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10115050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10115050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1011505001:0":{"text":"여기... 뭔가 익숙한데?","source_cn":"这附近，看着很眼熟！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE55A014A1093017B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1011505002:0":{"text":"어렸을 때 같이 이 근처를 탐험했잖아. 황혼의 나무에 가서 기도도 드리고. 까먹은 거야?","source_cn":"咱们小时候来这附近探险过，还一起去流荧树下祈祷，你忘记了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC9AA451C566427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1011505003:0":{"text":"맞아, 그랬지... 정말 오래됐다. 그때가 그립네.","source_cn":"对哦……那是很久之前了，真让人怀念。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52A549246BA51F60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1011505004:0":{"text":"그땐 부패도 없었고 아든 할아버지에게 지도도 받았는데...","source_cn":"那个时候，腐化没有出现，雅顿老爷子也还在教导我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77C87063893B9FC7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"로잔","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"라이카","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":2}}